#, php-format
msgid ""
"Domain mismatch: this gateway serves \"%1$s\", not your site domain "
"\"%2$s\". Lightning addresses may not resolve on your domain."
msgstr ""
"Dominio no coincidente: este gateway sirve \"%1$s\", no el dominio de tu "
"sitio \"%2$s\". Las Lightning Address podrían no resolverse en tu dominio."

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:70
msgid "Lightning by LaWallet"
msgstr "Lightning by LaWallet"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:96
msgid "LaWallet gateway endpoint is not configured."
msgstr "El endpoint del gateway de LaWallet no está configurado."

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:129
msgid "You are not allowed to update LaWallet settings."
msgstr "No tienes permisos para actualizar los ajustes de LaWallet."

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:149
msgid "Enter a valid http(s) LaWallet gateway endpoint before connecting."
msgstr ""
"Introduce un endpoint http(s) válido del gateway de LaWallet antes de "
"conectar."

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:178 includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:203
msgid "You are not allowed to verify LaWallet settings."
msgstr "No tienes permisos para verificar los ajustes de LaWallet."

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:216
msgid "Enter a valid http(s) LaWallet gateway endpoint."
msgstr "Introduce un endpoint http(s) válido del gateway de LaWallet."

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:226
msgid "LaWallet instance found."
msgstr "Instancia de LaWallet encontrada."

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:256
msgid "LaWallet instance connected"
msgstr "Instancia de LaWallet conectada"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:271
msgid "WooCommerce Lightning payments"
msgstr "Pagos Lightning en WooCommerce"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:273
msgid ""
"Accept checkout payments with a merchant Lightning Address. Orders are "
"completed only after the backend verifies LUD-21 settlement."
msgstr ""
"Acepta pagos en el checkout con una Lightning Address de comerciante. Los "
"pedidos se completan solo después de que el servidor verifique la "
"liquidación LUD-21."

#. translators: %s is a Lightning Address.
#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:279
#, php-format
msgid "Payment Lightning Address: %s"
msgstr "Lightning Address de pago: %s"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:283
msgid "Payment Lightning Address is not configured"
msgstr "La Lightning Address de pago no está configurada"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:289
msgid "Configure WooCommerce payments"
msgstr "Configurar los pagos de WooCommerce"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:293
msgid ""
"WooCommerce is installed but inactive. Activate WooCommerce to enable "
"Lightning checkout payments."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce está instalado pero inactivo. Activa WooCommerce para habilitar "
"los pagos Lightning en el checkout."

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:296
msgid "Open plugins"
msgstr "Abrir plugins"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:300
msgid ""
"WooCommerce is required to accept checkout payments. Install WooCommerce "
"from WordPress to enable this payment gateway."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce es necesario para aceptar pagos en el checkout. Instala "
"WooCommerce desde WordPress para habilitar esta pasarela de pago."

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:303
msgid "Install WooCommerce"
msgstr "Instalar WooCommerce"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:310
msgid "Provide lightning addresses with your domain"
msgstr "Ofrece Lightning Address con tu dominio"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:313
msgid ""
"Enabled lightning addresses for your users using this domain. You need to "
"connect to a lawallet.io or host your own instance. It's free and fully open "
"source."
msgstr ""
"Habilita Lightning Address para tus usuarios usando este dominio. Necesitas "
"conectarte a una instancia de lawallet.io o alojar la tuya propia. Es gratis "
"y totalmente de código abierto."

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:314
msgid "Learn more at lawallet.io"
msgstr "Más información en lawallet.io"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:321
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Conectado"

#: includes/class-wcll-discovery.php:323
